  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-30-50">お馬がたれた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-50-73">なあがいおくび</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-73-99">菜の花たべようと</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-99-124">そうろりたれた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-124-141">花がゆれた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-141-161">黄色い花だよ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-161-184">お鼻のところで</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-184-209">ゆうらりゆれた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-209-229">お馬はたべぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-229-249">お花をたべぬ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-249-269">お耳をたれて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-269-293">にほひをかいでる</seg></p>
    </body>
